  clock: 3  # 5972
  nonce: '5972'  # 5972
  message: "Merged in PR #1504 (a758a7081c). discovery.INSTALLED_DEP_RULES detects installed dependency source by content (Mix deps/: mix.exs+mix.lock beside or deps/*/hex_metadata.config; node_modules/: package.json beside or npm/yarn/pnpm state file; Composer vendor/autoload.php; Go vendor/modules.txt; Bundler vendor/bundle; CocoaPods Pods/Manifest.lock; virtualenvs); committed dirs (non-dot entries in HEAD via git ls-tree) are never installed and are analysed as tier 3; node_modules/vendor left DEFAULT_EXCLUDES; build output (.elixir_ls, Mix cover/, Phoenix priv/static/assets, .dart_tool, .stack-work, elm-stuff) excluded. Disclosure: stderr line, sketch Overview line, supply_chain_summary.installed_deps_skipped {dirs,packages,entries}. --trace-deps <pkg,...|all|none> on sketch/survey/slice + trace_deps config key; results-cache state segment gets -deps-all/-deps-<hash>. Behavioural evidence: Mix fixture (mix.exs, mix.lock, lib/app.ex App.hi -> Foo.greet, deps/foo + hex_metadata.config) via 'hypergumbo survey': default -> 0 deps/ nodes, App.hi -> elixir:Foo:0-0:greet:external_symbol, stderr 'Installed dependency source not analysed: deps/ (1 Mix package)...', sketch carries the line, io-boundaries prints the I/O-unknown disclosure naming Foo; --trace-deps foo and all -> Foo/Foo.greet tier 3, call resolves to deps/foo/lib/foo.ex; trace_deps=[\"foo\"] in .hypergumbo.toml -> io-boundaries shows fs_write via Foo.greet; deps/ committed to git -> tier 3 by default. Real repo: cold sketch of ~/special_repos/thc_dev (fresh XDG_CACHE_HOME): 49,568 symbols / 163,259 edges / 4,984 files, wall 5:11.7, peak RSS 2.45 GiB; graph identical to a new-code cold sketch of pristine ~/special_repos/thc (49,568/163,259, wall 5:02.4); vs 8.1.0 baseline (49,539/163,207/4,979) the delta is thc's committed assets/vendor/topbar.js + assets/css/vendor/*.css now analysed. Tests: test_installed_dependency_source.py (86 tests); smart-test affected run 28,707 passed, changed files 100%. Follow-ups: WI-tisuj (--exclude not in cache key), WI-hufop (dependency cache by package@version), WI-tozof (uncovered ecosystems + phx.digest); nondeterministic test-framework sample noted on WI-vosag."  # 5972
